NAME
    gcloud beta observability buckets datasets links - manage Link resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta observability buckets datasets links COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Link resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create links.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete links.

     describe
        (BETA) Describe links.

     list
        (BETA) List links.

     update
        (BETA) Update links.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice.

